                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "700f3744-b747-40b0-926b-4ccf7823ec36",
                                "sense_id": "73a558e4-f539-3054-b5f3-5e926db0eacb",
                                "text": "Nehmen Sie den Energiebereich, da haben wir einen technologischen Zielkonflikt: Erdwärmepumpen sind bei Weitem die effizienteste Form, Wärme aus der Umgebung zu ziehen, weil der Boden konstante Temperaturen hat, während die Luft im Winter Minusgrade haben kann. Wir müssten also dafür sorgen, dass so viele Erdwärmepumpen wie möglich installiert werden[…].",
                                "translation": "Take the energy sector, there we have a technological trade-off: geothermal heat pumps are by far the most efficient way of drawing heat from the environment because the ground has constant temperatures, whereas the air can be sub-zero in winter. So we would have to make sure that as many geothermal heat pumps as possible are installed … .",
                                "english": "Take the energy sector, there we have a technological trade-off: geothermal heat pumps are by far the most efficient way of drawing heat from the environment because the ground has constant temperatures, whereas the air can be sub-zero in winter. So we would have to make sure that as many geothermal heat pumps as possible are installed … ."
                            }
